    "updated_at": "2025-09-03T18:58:39Z",
    "body": "So I just commented on the other issue, but I actually meant to ask you if you could file a Chrome bug. I've moved this one over to the Chrome bug tracker, here:\n\n- https://issues.chromium.org/issues/442860464\n\nPlease take a look there - I've added a few more comments, and a repro that uses `interestfor`. The issue with the repro you linked here is that it manually adds closewatchers, and hover interactions don't count as \"user activation\" for those. However, `interestfor` is different since it's a native feature.\n\nI'll leave this issue open, in case I misunderstood something about your issue.",
